# Backend & Data

## Supabase

- Migrations only in `supabase/migrations/` — never hand-edit production
- Seed curated starter data in `supabase/seed.sql`
- Row Level Security on every user-data table
- Onboarding works guest-first; auth optional until dashboard

## API (Express)

- Validate all request bodies with Zod middleware
- Separate endpoints: `/motifs/detect` (deterministic) vs `/puzzles/generate` (LLM)
- Return `{ data }` on success, `{ error, code }` on failure
- Idempotent peek recording: dedupe by `(match_id, ply)`

## Security

- LLM and service keys server-side only — never in mobile bundle
- `.env.local` for secrets; provide `.env.example` with placeholder keys
- Rate-limit LLM templating endpoint

## Key Tables

`profiles`, `heatmap_ledger`, `puzzle_bank` are implemented. Planned match work may add `peek_events` and `matches`. See `heatmap-analytics` skill for ledger semantics.

## Peek → Puzzle

Peek event → queue FEN → motif engine → LLM template → `puzzle_bank` row with `source = 'peek'`.
